{"url":"https://api.github.com/repos/godotengine/godot/pulls/124084","id":4713351936,"node_id":"PR_kwDOAO6SJc8AAAABGPALAA","html_url":"https://github.com/godotengine/godot/pull/124084","diff_url":"https://github.com/godotengine/godot/pull/124084.diff","patch_url":"https://github.com/godotengine/godot/pull/124084.patch","issue_url":"https://api.github.com/repos/godotengine/godot/issues/124084","commits_url":"https://api.github.com/repos/godotengine/godot/pulls/124084/commits","review_comments_url":"https://api.github.com/repos/godotengine/godot/pulls/124084/comments","review_comment_url":"https://api.github.com/repos/godotengine/godot/pulls/comments{/number}","comments_url":"https://api.github.com/repos/godotengine/godot/issues/124084/comments","statuses_url":"https://api.github.com/repos/godotengine/godot/statuses/5920b7055a7a69b716ded94d4bd7b9ece47e77e6","number":124084,"state":"closed","locked":false,"title":"Add Inspector descriptions for exported C# members","user":{"login":"xdraffa","id":70499895,"node_id":"MDQ6VXNlcjcwNDk5ODk1","avatar_url":"https://avatars.githubusercontent.com/u/70499895?v=4","gravatar_id":"","url":"https://api.github.com/users/xdraffa","html_url":"https://github.com/xdraffa","followers_url":"https://api.github.com/users/xdraffa/followers","following_url":"https://api.github.com/users/xdraffa/following{/other_user}","gists_url":"https://api.github.com/users/xdraffa/gists{/gist_id}","starred_url":"https://api.github.com/users/xdraffa/starred{/owner}{/repo}","subscriptions_url":"https://api.github.com/users/xdraffa/subscriptions","organizations_url":"https://api.github.com/users/xdraffa/orgs","repos_url":"https://api.github.com/users/xdraffa/repos","events_url":"https://api.github.com/users/xdraffa/events{/privacy}","received_events_url":"https://api.github.com/users/xdraffa/received_events","type":"User","user_view_type":"public","site_admin":false},"body":"<!--\r\nPlease target the `master` branch. We will take care of backporting relevant fixes to older versions.\r\n\r\nBefore submitting, please read our checklist for contributors:\r\nhttps://contributing.godotengine.org/en/latest/development/engine/introduction.html#checklist-for-new-contributors\r\n\r\nUse of AI must be disclosed and should include a description of how it was used.\r\n-->\r\n\r\n## What problem(s) does this PR solve?\r\n\r\nC# scripts can export fields and properties, but cannot define their Inspector tooltip descriptions in C# source. Add `[Description]` for exported fields, properties, and tool buttons. The source generator passes the description through the managed/native bridge to the editor's existing script documentation cache.\r\n\r\n```csharp\r\n[Export]\r\n[Description(\"Maximum number of instances this node can create.\")]\r\npublic int MaxInstances { get; set; } = 10;\r\n```\r\n\r\n## Additional information\r\n- The attribute is separate from `[Export]` and has no effect on members that are not exported.\r\n- Source-generator tests cover fields, properties, tool buttons, empty descriptions, string escaping, and inheritance. This change does not modify GDScript `##` parsing.\r\n- The .NET editor and SDK build successfully. The source-generator suite passes (43/43), and the resulting editor and SDK were tested in a Godot project.\r\n- Related discussion: https://github.com/godotengine/godot-proposals/discussions/5675. The C# export guide update is prepared in a separate godot-docs branch.\r\n- Generated proposal https://github.com/godotengine/godot-proposals/issues/15594\r\n- Documentation will be added to [tutorials/scripting/c_sharp/c_sharp_exports.rst](https://github.com/godotengine/godot-docs/blob/master/tutorials/scripting/c_sharp/c_sharp_exports.rst) to describe the new `[Description]` tag\r\n\r\n[!INFO] **AI disclosure:** Codex assisted with tests, part of the implementation, documentation, and PR text. The contributor tested the resulting editor and SDK in a Godot project; automated source-generator tests and the local build also passed.\r\n<!--\r\nProvide additional information and explanation of your PR, including areas that you are uncertain of or require special attention from reviewers. For examples, please read our pull request guidelines: https://contributing.godotengine.org/en/latest/development/contribution_rules.html#explain-your-contributions\r\n-->\r\n","labels":[{"id":279096997,"node_id":"MDU6TGFiZWwyNzkwOTY5OTc=","url":"https://api.github.com/repos/godotengine/godot/labels/archived","name":"archived","description":"","color":"aaaaaa","default":false,"archived_at":null,"archived_by":null}],"milestone":null,"active_lock_reason":null,"created_at":"2026-10-02T06:18:40Z","updated_at":"2026-10-02T08:19:40Z","closed_at":"2026-10-02T08:12:02Z","merged_at":null,"merge_commit_sha":"4493c1e0ebbf7068876e9ccd15f3b2eb3dbf84c8","assignee":null,"assignees":[],"requested_reviewers":[],"requested_teams":[],"head":{"label":"xdraffa:dotnet/inspector-descriptions","ref":"dotnet/inspector-descriptions","repo":{"id":1401014494,"node_id":"R_kgDOU4HI3g","name":"godot","full_name":"xdraffa/godot","owner":{"login":"xdraffa","id":70499895,"node_id":"MDQ6VXNlcjcwNDk5ODk1","avatar_url":"https://avatars.githubusercontent.com/u/70499895?v=4","gravatar_id":"","url":"https://api.github.com/users/xdraffa","html_url":"https://github.com/xdraffa","followers_url":"https://api.github.com/users/xdraffa/followers","following_url":"https://api.github.com/users/xdraffa/following{/other_user}","gists_url":"https://api.github.com/users/xdraffa/gists{/gist_id}","starred_url":"https://api.github.com/users/xdraffa/starred{/owner}{/repo}","subscriptions_url":"https://api.github.com/users/xdraffa/subscriptions","organizations_url":"https://api.github.com/users/xdraffa/orgs","repos_url":"https://api.github.com/users/xdraffa/repos","events_url":"https://api.github.com/users/xdraffa/events{/privacy}","received_events_url":"https://api.github.com/users/xdraffa/received_events","type":"User","user_view_type":"public"